[
    {
        "text": "I treat it like a game. So I don't know if you have the same thing, but, like, I personally love the trading aspect of it because I feel like it's a game. It's like, why would I play Fortnite right now when I could play this game and I could just trade and make money? And it's like, if you get really good at this game, then you can actually make real money. And it is funny that there's a lot of people that are like, oh, well, once they integrate tokens into these games, you can play games and make money. But it's like, no, the trading is the game for me. You know, people say it's not skill based. It absolutely is.",
